    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "57E1D6FA3247509D",
      "text": "Hahahaha! You have claimed an artistic win![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "57E1D5FA32474EEA",
      "text": "Our collaborations are always the greatest of\\nworks! Your sense for art is honed to perfection![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "57E1D4FA32474D37",
      "text": "My thanks to you.\\c\\nI will bestow on you the latest merchandise to be\\nsold at my exhibits. You’ll be the first to get one.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "57E1D3FA32474B84",
      "text": "It took the designers over six months to meet my\\nexacting standards, but at last we made true art.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_reward_00",
      "hash64": "B18D4AC0CF981C95",
      "text": "You received a [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Surrendering Sunflora Case [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]from\\nBrassius!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "AE478101CDB0DAAC",
      "text": "Hahahaha! What an artistic defeat!\\c\\nSince you’ve already gotten the best of me, you\\nmight as well take a little more![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "AE478201CDB0DC5F",
      "text": "I can’t hold back this flood of inspiration... Leave\\nme here, so I might continue to savor this feeling![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "A0955EEA7006A9B0",
      "text": "So this time you served to nourish my Pokémon!\\c\\nThe occasional defeat is a necessarily evil. Our\\npain can inspire the greatest art![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "1FDAFE1F72B4C8A3",
      "text": "The architecture of this academy displays a great\\nsense of design.\\c\\nI would like to know the name of the architect\\nwho devised it...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "1FDAFD1F72B4C6F0",
      "text": "In Pokémon battles, there will be times of\\nstruggle. The same is true of art.\\c\\nBut you must not abandon these pursuits. It is\\nwhen you stop struggling that you wither away.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 174,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "1FDB001F72B4CC09",
      "text": "You have had the opportunity to take Hass’s\\nclasses back in Paldea, have you not?\\c\\nYou should be aware of how lucky you are as you\\nmake your way in life.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 155,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "1FDAFF1F72B4CA56",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]I’d love to do a carving of the [VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\nyou\\r\\nentrusted\\r\\nme with, at some point.\\c\\nIt is truly avant-garde![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "1FDB021F72B4CF6F",
      "text": "Is the Sunflora I entrusted you with flourishing?\\c\\nYou must be diligent in ensuring he gets enough\\nsunlight and water.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
